    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Khorne Daemonkin",
    "summary": "An enemy unit’s destruction by your WORLD EATERS or BLOOD LEGIONS triggers one D6 roll. A 3+ gives you 1 Blood Tithe point. As your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) opens, you may buy any number of affordable effects below. Each lasts until the battle ends. For 2 points, your WORLD EATERS and BLOOD LEGIONS models get [Feel No Pain 5+](vsdata:core-ability/feel-no-pain) for two sources of damage, [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) and Psychic Attacks. BLOOD LEGIONS get [[LANCE](vsdata:weapon-ability/lance)] for melee weapons for 3 points, a 4+ invulnerable save for 4 points, or [Blessings of Khorne](vsdata:ability/world-eaters.blessings-of-khorne) for 5 points.",
